L162: **Supplementary Material 1: Organic Synthesis**
L163: NMR spectra were recorded in CDCl3 (Cambridge Isotopes Laboratories) on either a Bruker
L164: Avance DPX-300 MHz or 400 MHz instruments. Bruker TOPSPIN 3.5 PL2 (400 MHz) and
L165: Bruker TOPSPIN 2.1 PL6 software (300 MHz) were used to analyse FID data. Chemical shifts
L166: were reported as δ values and coupling constants as _J_ -values in Hertz (Hz).
L167: Trichlorofluoromethane (CFCl3) was the internal standard for [19] F-NMR (282 MHz).
L168: Electron impact (EI) and fast atom bombardment (FAB) mass spectra were recorded on a
L169: Thermo Scientific high resolution double focusing magnetic sector mass spectrometer.
L170: Electrospray ionization (ES) used a Bruker HCT Plus Proteineer LC-MS.
